      "basis": "C13-R1 located decisive evidence for the implemented ZCRM02/KUNNR/ZUONR/PutNonEmpty behavior. However, no selected item located decisive authority for the ticket-source business rule or other agreed constraints such as XBLNR_ALT, header funding row, reversal, or IF-097 preservation."
